Start at $(0,0)$. The outward ride ends at $(2,24)$. The stop lasts $0.5$ hours and ends at $(2.5,24)$. Aria reaches home after $2+0.5+1=3.5$ hours, giving $(3.5,0)$. Plot these points and join consecutive points. The stop is horizontal and the return slopes down.
[tikz]
% mathsmap-diagram-colours {"version":1,"kind":"graph","base":[],"semantic":[]}
